#: ../../source/ignore_README.md:38
msgid ""
"`ignore` is a manager, filter and parser which implemented in pure "
"JavaScript according to the .gitignore [spec](http://git-"
"scm.com/docs/gitignore)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ignore_README.md:40
msgid ""
"Pay attention that [`minimatch`](https://www.npmjs.org/package/minimatch)"
" does not work in the gitignore way. To filter filenames according to "
".gitignore file, I recommend this module."
msgstr ""

