#: ../../source/ignore_README.md:92
msgid ""
"`ignore` is a standalone module, and is much simpler so that it could "
"easy work with other programs, unlike "
"[isaacs](https://npmjs.org/~isaacs)'s [fstream-"
"ignore](https://npmjs.org/package/fstream-ignore) which must work with "
"the modules of the fstream family."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ignore_README.md:94
msgid ""
"`ignore` only contains utility methods to filter paths according to the "
"specified ignore rules, so"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ignore_README.md:95
msgid ""
"`ignore` never try to find out ignore rules by traversing directories or "
"fetching from git configurations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ignore_README.md:96
msgid "`ignore` don't cares about sub-modules of git projects."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/ignore_README.md:98
msgid ""
"Exactly according to [gitignore man page](http://git-"
"scm.com/docs/gitignore), fixes some known matching issues of fstream-"
"ignore, such as:"
